1
00:00:04,490 --> 00:00:06,759
Metal Cardbot Commentary!

2
00:00:06,759 --> 00:00:09,253
A Fire Truck Afraid of Fire! 

3
00:00:10,452 --> 00:00:13,144
{Jun} Hello, friends! I'm Jun.

4
00:00:13,144 --> 00:00:16,533
{Jun} Let's watch the story of Metal Cardbot together!

5
00:00:16,533 --> 00:00:19,355
{Jun} It's "Metal Cardbot Commentary" time!

6
00:00:19,355 --> 00:00:21,644
Phoenix Fire, Setup!

7
00:00:22,385 --> 00:00:23,623
{Phoenix Fire} Hello, everyone!

8
00:00:23,623 --> 00:00:25,960
{Phoenix Fire} My name is Phoenix Fire.

9
00:00:25,960 --> 00:00:28,978
{Phoenix Fire} I am a brave rescue worker from Planet Machina.

10
00:00:28,978 --> 00:00:31,507
{Jun} Nice to meet you, Phoenix Fire!

11
00:00:31,507 --> 00:00:34,418
{Jun} Today, let's watch the story of 

12
00:00:34,418 --> 00:00:37,430
{Jun} the brave rescue worker, Phoenix Fire!

13
00:00:37,430 --> 00:00:39,628
{Jun} Shall we get started?

14
00:00:45,784 --> 00:00:47,261
Surprise!

15
00:00:47,261 --> 00:00:49,987
Wow! This looks amazing!

16
00:00:51,587 --> 00:00:55,034
You see? Everyone loves a little bit of a performance.

17
00:00:55,034 --> 00:00:57,198
You really are the best, Dad!

18
00:00:59,423 --> 00:01:00,670
Huh? Is there a fire?

19
00:01:00,670 --> 00:01:02,448
It's getting closer...

20
00:01:08,117 --> 00:01:09,841
Fire! Please evacuate!

21
00:01:13,867 --> 00:01:15,061
Fire extinguished!

22
00:01:18,825 --> 00:01:20,837
{Jun} Phoenix Fire!

23
00:01:20,837 --> 00:01:24,650
{Jun} Why did you have to ruin the special gift I worked so hard to prepare for?

24
00:01:24,650 --> 00:01:27,375
{Phoenix Fire} I'm sorry, Jun. I didn't realize...

25
00:01:27,375 --> 00:01:29,759
{Jun} If she liked the gift, 

26
00:01:29,759 --> 00:01:32,643
{Jun} then maybe me and Anna could have...!

27
00:01:32,643 --> 00:01:35,473
{Phoenix Fire} I-I'm not so sure about that. Hahaha!

28
00:01:35,473 --> 00:01:40,098
{Jun} Wha?? Cut it out, Phoenix Fire!

29
00:01:40,098 --> 00:01:42,834
You can seal them, but you mustn't reveal the Metal Cardbots.

30
00:01:42,834 --> 00:01:45,402
I know, but... urgh!

31
00:01:45,402 --> 00:01:48,301
How do I set things straight with Anna then?

32
00:01:49,001 --> 00:01:50,537
Phoenix Fire.

33
00:01:50,537 --> 00:01:53,501
Huh? Do you know them, Mega Ambler?

34
00:01:53,501 --> 00:01:56,694
Yes. We were part of the same rescue team.

35
00:01:57,194 --> 00:01:59,213
He used to be the bravest firefighter.

36
00:01:59,213 --> 00:02:01,117
Always jumping head first into the flames.

37
00:02:01,117 --> 00:02:06,481
He received the Metal Medal, an honor awarded to only the best rescuers on planet Machina.

38
00:02:07,182 --> 00:02:12,640
{Jun} Wow, Phoenix Fire! You must've been a great rescue worker!

39
00:02:12,640 --> 00:02:17,231
{Phoenix Fire} I was brave back then. The flames didn't bother me!

40
00:02:17,231 --> 00:02:21,102
{Jun} Heat couldn't hold you back, huh? In that case~!

41
00:02:21,102 --> 00:02:22,368
{Phoenix Fire} Ow! Hot!

42
00:02:22,368 --> 00:02:24,637
{Phoenix Fire} I'm not saying I couldn't feel the heat!

43
00:02:24,637 --> 00:02:28,008
{Phoenix Fire} I- Where did he go? Jun! Get back here!

44
00:02:28,008 --> 00:02:29,643
Jun, that's a smoke bomb! Don't touch it, it's not safe.

45
00:02:29,643 --> 00:02:31,379
Oh! Okay...

46
00:02:39,125 --> 00:02:40,396
Huh?

47
00:02:41,075 --> 00:02:42,802
Is that another fire truck?

48
00:02:42,802 --> 00:02:43,903
It's him!

49
00:02:50,367 --> 00:02:54,563
{Jun} Why does everyone break something when they show up?

50
00:03:04,072 --> 00:03:07,627
This is great! Step on the gas and let's dance the night away!

51
00:03:08,282 --> 00:03:09,967
I told you to stay still!

52
00:03:13,268 --> 00:03:14,627
Theo! Are you okay?!

53
00:03:15,433 --> 00:03:17,163
{Phoenix Fire} Ah, haha...

54
00:03:17,163 --> 00:03:19,578
{Phoenix Fire} In my haste, I didn't realize...

55
00:03:19,578 --> 00:03:24,073
{Jun} You can't just break anything you'd like on Earth!

56
00:03:41,973 --> 00:03:43,567
Blue Cop, use your Burst Shot!

57
00:03:43,567 --> 00:03:44,170
Got it!

58
00:03:45,394 --> 00:03:46,786
Burst Shot!

59
00:03:49,406 --> 00:03:52,138
Huh? Fire...?

60
00:03:52,213 --> 00:03:53,367
Augh!

61
00:03:59,623 --> 00:04:00,764
That's...

62
00:04:00,764 --> 00:04:03,034
That's Phoenix Fire's Metal Medal...

63
00:04:05,605 --> 00:04:09,830
Fire! Everything will go up in flames if I don't stop this...

64
00:04:13,155 --> 00:04:18,730
{Jun} I'm sorry, Phoenix Fire. I didn't know you had such a painful experience.

65
00:04:18,730 --> 00:04:19,959
{Phoenix Fire} It's okay, Jun.

66
00:04:19,959 --> 00:04:24,192
{Phoenix Fire} Along with those memories, I also remembered my brave days as a rescue team member.

67
00:04:24,192 --> 00:04:27,514
{Jun} Really? Phew, that's a relief.

68
00:04:27,514 --> 00:04:29,661
{Jun} Ah! I almost forgot...

69
00:04:29,661 --> 00:04:32,608
{Jun} there's still some piping hot apple pie at home.

70
00:04:32,608 --> 00:04:34,055
{Phoenix Fire} "Piping hot"?

71
00:04:34,055 --> 00:04:35,622
{Phoenix Fire} I have to put it out, quickly!

72
00:04:35,622 --> 00:04:41,641
{Jun} P-Phoenix Fire! Are you okay?

73
00:04:44,427 --> 00:04:48,250
{Jun} Well, everyone? What did you think?

74
00:04:48,250 --> 00:04:51,706
{Jun} A fire truck afraid of fire. I finally succeeded in sealing Phoenix Fire!

75
00:04:51,706 --> 00:04:55,925
{Jun} Now then, look forward to the next "Metal Cardbot Commentary"!

